@startuml
title MW-09 - Notifications and Reminders

start
:Open the application;

:Open the realtime notification connection;
:Wait for a reminder event;

if (Any reminder?) then (Yes)
  :Display the notification;
  :Update the time slot status;
  :Update the unread notification counter;
else (No)
endif

:Open the inbox;
:Select "All" or "Unread";

:Load the notification list;
:Display the list;

:Mark as read or mark all as read;

:Update the read status;
:Update the unread notification counter;

stop
@enduml
